This looks like someone asked, “What if an AI startup launch video had a budget, but only for explosions?”  

We’ve got a giant cyber-elephant stomping through a city like it just found out about rent prices, helicopters doing their best “we are absolutely not prepared for this” impression, and the words **LLM CHAIN** sitting there in the middle like they’re the hero of a movie that clearly got out of hand. It’s basically the tech equivalent of saying, “We’re disrupting the industry,” and then immediately the industry calls security.
